# Git Commit Rules for MiniKlaim

## STRICT RULE: NO CO-AUTHOR TRAILERS

All commits MUST be authored solely by 0xj4an.

❌ NEVER include:
- Co-authored-by: Cursor <...>
- Co-authored-by: 0xj4an (Personal Account) <...>
- Any other Co-authored-by trailer

✅ The git hook `.git/hooks/prepare-commit-msg` automatically removes these.

## Author Configuration

```bash
git config user.name "0xj4an"
git config user.email "personal@0xj4an.xyz"
```

## Verification

Before pushing:
```bash
git log -1 --format="%B" HEAD
```

Should show ONLY the commit message, no trailers.
